      "id": "span-5f782d81-63c7-4904-bce1-026253b90960",
      "chapter_id": "ch-a197e8c5-d900-4519-8504-3c6f47ae809b",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-f5e47549-30ca-414b-9a42-776a9757fb5f",
      "chapter_id": "ch-7886b7a5-e127-451c-8fbd-f1be99005f55",
      "chapter_number": 4,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚看得懂潮表上的坐标，却还不知道‘廊桥钥匙’这个代号指向什么。",
      "sha256": "acdbf3c6f280f8ce238bfd95fffc9f29461689cbd936b4002c519c4f303b5657"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-bb307c59-743c-49ff-87c6-fe3a4483935b",
      "chapter_id": "ch-9950f5eb-09a3-4274-b626-75d9f850a4ad",
      "chapter_number": 3,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "十九点二十，西航道先退潮，最后一班渡船在十九点四十才离开风栈码头。",
      "sha256": "640927d1eac69fe6ff8247bbfbb362071d6d8421fe6e6ec6901da4a44471ccb6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
